{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "%lld mornings answered": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "答えた朝 %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "32 mornings answered": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "答えた朝 32"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A morning alarm that asks one question.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "毎朝、ひとつの問いで\n起こす目覚まし。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quiet reminder asks: are you keeping it?": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「守れてますか?」のリマインドでループを閉じます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Answer it, and the alarm stops.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "答えると、アラームは止まります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Answer the question to stop the alarm.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "問いに答えて、アラームを止める。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Answer to stop": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "答えて、止める"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Answered mornings remain as dots.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "答えた朝が、\n点として残る。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Are you keeping it?": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "守れてますか?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At night, check in with your morning self.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "夜、朝の自分と\n答え合わせ。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Call my mother and talk for a while": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "母に長い電話をかける"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dawn comes with a question.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "夜明けは、問いとともに。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each row is a week. Answered mornings remain as dots.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1行が一週間。答えた朝が、点として残る。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each row is a week. The dots will connect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1行が一週間。点は、いつかつながる。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eat my favorite meal at my favorite place": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "行きつけの店で好きなものを食べる"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every morning's answer becomes a journal of your life.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "毎朝の答えが、\n人生の記録になる。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Follow-up alarms return until this morning's answer exists.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "回答が成立するまで、追撃アラームが戻ってきます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Go see the ocean with my family": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "家族と海を見に行く"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I did": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "やれた"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If today were your last day, what would you want to do?": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今日死ぬとしたら何をやりたいですか？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In 7 hr 20 min · Tap the time to change": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "あと 7 時間 20 分 · 時刻をタップして変更"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It keeps ringing until you answer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "答えるまで、鳴り止まない。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Journal": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ジャーナル"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep these seven days on one card": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この七日を、一枚に"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Life Calendar": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "人生カレンダー"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make it today's answer": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "これで確定する"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Memento mori, every morning.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "毎朝、死を想ってから\n起きる。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "やれていない"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Older mornings unlock with Premium.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "7日より前の朝は、プレミアムで。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On day seven, meet your seven answers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "七日目、七つの答えと再会する。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the seventh morning": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "7日目の朝に"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quiet milestones keep you coming back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "静かな節目が、続く理由になります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Say what I never could": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "誰にも言えなかったことを伝える"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "See every morning": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "すべての朝を見る"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "設定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Seven Mornings": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "七つの朝"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Seven answers, together on one page for the first time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "七日分の答えが、はじめて一枚に並びました"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spend the whole day with my kids": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "子どもと一日中遊ぶ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The alarm is ringing": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "アラームが鳴っています"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The dots will connect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点は、いつかつながる。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The question waits for tomorrow's you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "問いが、明日のあなたを待っています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This morning's words": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今朝のことば"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Today": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今日"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tomorrow morning, the question rings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "明日の朝、問いが鳴る。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tonight, set the alarm. Morning changes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今夜セットすれば、\n朝が変わる。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wake up to the question.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "問いで、目を覚ます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Watch the sunrise to the end": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "朝日を最後まで眺める"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write a letter to an old friend": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "友人に手紙を書く"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your answers gather here, one morning at a time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "回答は、ひと朝ずつここに集まっていきます。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
